# What git tracks. This is NOT the same question as what gets deployed --
# that is .vercelignore, which excludes _build/ and *.py from the site.
#
# _build/ is deliberately NOT listed here. Despite the name it holds source,
# not output: the 20 article bodies, articles.json, the image manifest and
# build.ps1. The generated output is articles/. Losing _build/ would mean
# losing the writing and the ability to rebuild the site, so it belongs in
# version control even though it must never be served.

# One-off patch scripts (fix_*.py, update_*.py) that have already been applied.
# Remove this line if you want them kept.
*.py

# Local scratch and tooling.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.vercel/
.mimocode/
